cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Unpublished local release candidate. If you use FrameIt, cite the version you
  actually used. The DOI below identifies the project, not a published candidate.
title: "FrameIt: Focused Regional Analysis of Modeled Events with Integrated Tracking"
abstract: >-
  FrameIt extracts fixed or moving regional datasets from selected AROME,
  Meso-NH, NEMO and CROCO outputs. Configuration declares fields, levels,
  tracking and optional polar sampling. NetCDF and optional Zarr products retain
  source distinctions for analysis with ordinary readers and researchers' own
  tools. Method-specific applicability and scientific qualification limits apply.
